{"id":"wb-7-718","name":"李纯祠堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李纯祠堂","text":"李纯祠堂位于中国天津市南开区白堤路西侧，是北洋政府直系军阀李纯的祠堂。始建于1913年至1923年期间。目前，李纯祠堂被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，天津市文物保护单位和重点保护等级历史风貌建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E7%BA%AF%E7%A5%A0%E5%A0%82","revisionId":89705927,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89705927","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d70a6e6ba0000d4a7dc51b79.jpg","title":"Tientsin_nankai_lichuncitang_Chent_001.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tientsin_nankai_lichuncitang_Chent_001.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/Tientsin_nankai_lichuncitang_Chent_001.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"中文維基百科的Chent","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​李纯祠堂戏台","width":320,"height":240}}